{{#html:MathJaxCalc}}

年：{{MathVar|Y|low=1957|high=2030|highlight=2000}}

月：{{MathVar|M|low=1|high=12|highlight=1}}

日：{{MathVar|D|low=1|high=31|highlight=1}}

时：{{MathVar|h|low=0|high=24|highlight=12}}

分：{{MathVar|m|low=0|high=60|highlight=0}}

秒：{{MathVar|s|low=0|high=60|highlight=0}}

中间变量：{{math|1= a = \mathrm{floor}((14-M)/12)|calc=1|showresult=0}}，{{math|1= y = Y + 4800 - a|calc=1|showresult=0}}，{{math|1= M_0 = M+12*a-3|calc=1|showresult=0}}

只考虑日月年时，儒略日为：{{math|1 = J_0 = D +  \mathrm{floor}((153*M_0 + 2)/5) + 365*y + \mathrm{floor}(y/4) - \mathrm{floor}(y/100) + \mathrm{floor}(y/400) - 32045 |calc=1}}

进一步考虑时分秒，儒略日为：{{math|1 = J_1 = J_0 + (h - 12)/24 + m/1440 + s/86400|calc=1}}

简化儒略日表示为：{{math|1 = J_2 = J_1 - 2400000.5 |calc=1}}

